## Setup structure (not 11 sidebar items)

Wizard (first-time): Phone → Forwarding → Recovery → Consent → Texting → Test  
Edit mode sections: Phone & Forwarding | What Counts as Missed | Text Back | Consent | Hours | Follow-up Rules | Links & Request Form | Exclusions | Test & Activate

## Domain objects (use canonical names)

Missed call, Conversation, Consent event, Suppression, Recovery configuration, Business line, Forwarding destination, SMS sender, Exclusion — see full map for homes.

## Status vocabulary (do not invent synonyms)

Recovery: Eligible | Scheduled | Sending | Sent | Delivered | Suppressed | Failed  
Consent: Captured | Existing permission | Not captured | Opted out | Unknown  
Sender: Ready | Registration required | Pending | Needs information | Rejected | Suspended  
Service: Active | Paused | Needs attention | Setup incomplete

