Rebuild MCTB as one coherent domain. Daily ops (Missed Calls, Conversations) get highest nav prominence. Configuration under Setup. Every feature one canonical home. Every state one runtime source. Centralized eligibility. No duplicate architecture from legacy routes or screenshots.
